  "delivered": [
    "An independent original weighted-language EMD workbench exposes evaluate_emd and scalar earth_movers_distance on caller-supplied language pairs, plus derive_stochastic_language on an original full EventLog with a separate normalize flag. Existing log-derived EMD remains accessible.",
    "Original language vectors retain ordered duplicate traces, empty words and labels, literal native bytes, exact weights and independent stored total_mass. IEEE signed zero, subnormals and NaN/INF/-INF remain inspectable; native algorithms retain responsibility for weight validation, consolidation, normalization and solver behavior.",
    "All four native value options retain constructor defaults and supplied-member presence. Four independent nullable finite cost-table adapters bind the real distance, encoded_distance, string_distance and utf8_string_distance callback slots. Exact keys, full uint32 storage, ordered duplicates, first match, fallback and explicit throw outcomes are retained.",
    "Native callback priority and every actual invocation are reported with slot, complete arguments, entry index, fallback/missing flags and full outcome. NativeString and versioned raw-log carriers preserve arbitrary byte storage, including malformed UTF8 and paired WTF8 bytes, without decode/re-encode substitution.",
    "A returned six-field EmdResult with computed=false is a successful executed native evaluation. The scalar wrapper follows its own native exception path and returns no fabricated EmdResult. Parsed prefixes, configured options, callback state, original bytes/SHA and before/after snapshots survive applicable owned failures.",
    "Eight independent artifacts have authoritative bytecarriers and actual separate export errors. A successful nontext artifact can have null display text with no export error. Original/request/response/report, complete native tables, CSV and selected-record downloads preserve full bytes and numeric tokens; derived languages reopen as original pair inputs.",
    "The independent UI provides all three operations, original weighted-language/EventLog uploads and exact editors, all native value fields and finite callback tables, ownership/cancellation and full result/error/artifact inspection. Actual native API fixtures drive request replay and complete offline export validation."
  ],
  "boundaries": [
    "This checkpoint does not establish full PM4Py parity or promote a strict package/module. All 86 families, 387 modules and 228 incomplete strict units remain in scope; strict counts remain 46/86 packages and 199/387 modules.",
    "One fresh browser retry followed the user settings-change notice during Feature66 development while Feature65 was live. The server was listening and returned HTTP200; the browser tool rejected the call under a saved/managed access gate. Current Feature66 HTTP/API/assets are separate evidence; rendered controls, interaction and browser downloads remain unverified.",
    "Finite declarative tables bind the four actual C++ callback slots; arbitrary C++ function bodies are not serializable JSON. These adapters require no external model and make no model-quality or general executable callback transport claim.",
    "The native solver recomputes mass from trace weights and can ignore stored total_mass, consolidate duplicates or reject invalid weights/costs. The original constructors remain exact and no semantic caps, sorting, hidden calls, clamps or fallback algorithms are added by the UI.",
    "Client cancellation prevents stale publication and does not stop a native call already executing. Independent raw EventLog derivation is separate from pair options; no imported or discovered substitute is fabricated.",
    "The final proof revalidates the same actual HTTP corpus offline, correcting three owner metadata assumptions about reserved upload parts without filenames. All original responses and nine failed owner-assumption checks remain retained. Offline validation performs no new HTTP calls; the actual main corpus is counted once, separately from bounded backend smoke and failed/superseded attempts. Its initial actual GET409 before the original seed and unchanged cache snapshots remain historical observations with unchanged chronology.",
    "Next prepare original OCPN/object-centric causal-net playout across four exact public surfaces and eighteen native options. The existing application path imports supplied OCEL and then discovers a model; original model input remains the next delivery, without a cached-session claim."
  ],
